name: Amoeba
# The first replicator: a Gatherer (collect, head for the nearest resource) that DIVIDEs
# every loop (D pops an empty stack = east): copies itself beside itself as a new
# warrior. Seven cells, so it fits under the size floor (a 9-cell version lost genes to
# upkeep shedding). Its descendants are rivals like anyone else.
---
C6S$TMD
